{"id": "5325d577-51c3-4f5e-ab03-3f778b75f367", "name": "セル内圧推定制約", "description": "理想気体の状態方程式（PV=nRT）を応用し、セルのガス体積、セル温度（ケルビン換算）、およびセル内の残空間から推定内圧（Pa）を算出します。分母が0になるのを防ぐため、残空間は微小な最小値を確保します。", "inputNames": ["gas_volume", "cell_temperature", "cell_remaining_volume"], "outputNames": ["estimated_internal_pressure"], "parameters": {}, "code": "estimated_internal_pressure = (gas_volume * 8.314 * (cell_temperature + 273.15)) / max(cell_remaining_volume, 0.001)", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T11:43:43.684097", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
