{"id": "6ae1e698-0b2c-405d-8124-c117f9b31a29", "name": "耐圧寿命簡易評価制約", "description": "SOCの影響を考慮せず、セルの耐圧限界とピーク内圧から簡易的な耐圧寿命(年)を算出します。", "inputNames": ["pressure_limit", "peak_pressure", "life_factor"], "outputNames": ["lifetime_no_soc"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# 耐圧寿命(SOC依存性考慮なし)の推定\n# 簡易的に、耐圧限界(kPa)と最大発生内圧(kPa)の差分比率から経年劣化劣化速度を評価\nlifetime_no_soc = max(0.0, (pressure_limit - peak_pressure) * life_factor)", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T11:43:46.011246", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
