{"id": "efacad65-7b1f-4098-b05e-83c0270adec6", "name": "耐圧寿命SOC依存評価制約", "description": "SOC高充填時のストレス因子(劣化加速度)を考慮して、より詳細な耐圧寿命を評価します。", "inputNames": ["lifetime_no_soc", "soc_stress_factor"], "outputNames": ["lifetime_with_soc"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# 耐圧寿命(SOC依存性考慮あり)の推定\n# SOC高充填状態における追加劣化加速度(soc_stress_factor)を考慮\n# 劣化加速度が小さいほど寿命が伸びる構成\nlifetime_with_soc = lifetime_no_soc * max(0.1, (1.0 / (soc_stress_factor + 0.01)))", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T11:43:46.022545", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
